    {''card'': 2.298, ''L5'': 2.343} (3 seeds, real-game judge). 27102 prisms measured;
    PhaseThresholds ride that count at the rail prism''s nominal volume plus a trail band.
    Flora and fauna: Serpentine Cell/Serpentine Cell Config 2''s spawn profile. Regenerate
    with Tools/Build/author_regatta_assets.py from Tools/Build/regatta_shuffle_pool.json,
    never by hand.'
